              <SHORT-NAME>If_SafetyHooks</SHORT-NAME>
              <DESC>
                <L-2 L="EN">The safety hooks of opendbc's safety layer (opendbc/safety/safety.h), called by the panda firmware; a C function-pointer table, described here as a client-server interface</L-2>
              </DESC>
              <ADMIN-DATA>
                <SDGS>
                  <SDG GID="LionDriver.Source">
                    <SD GID="workProduct">WP-S-03</SD>
                    <SD GID="clause">§3.3</SD>
                    <SD GID="path">opendbc_repo/opendbc/safety/safety.h</SD>
                  </SDG>
