                <L-4 L="EN">host.dm</L-4>
              </LONG-NAME>
              <DESC>
                <L-2 L="EN">Driver monitoring: dmonitoringmodeld runs the DM model (E-02), dmonitoringd applies the policy. A Linux process of openpilot, not an AUTOSAR SWC. Runs the ML model of E-02 (allocated to this process in the SysML model); E-02 is not a separate SWC.</L-2>
              </DESC>
              <ADMIN-DATA>
