            <COMPOSITION-SW-COMPONENT-TYPE>
              <SHORT-NAME>LdSda</SHORT-NAME>
              <LONG-NAME>
                <L-4 L="EN">LD-SDA (the item)</L-4>
              </LONG-NAME>
              <DESC>
                <L-2 L="EN">LD-SDA, the item: openpilot on the SoC and the panda safety firmware. E-02 runs inside modeld and dm; E-04 hardware and E-05 harness are ECU-level and physical and appear as ECU instances and buses.</L-2>
              </DESC>
