            <GATEWAY>
              <SHORT-NAME>Panda_CameraForwarding</SHORT-NAME>
              <DESC>
                <L-2 L="EN">safety_fwd_hook copies every camera-bus frame to bus 0 unchanged except the TX messages with check_relay, which the item replaces (0x191, 0x2e4, 0x343, 0x412). Only the described frames are listed; every other camera frame is forwarded the same way.</L-2>
              </DESC>
