            <ECU-INSTANCE>
              <SHORT-NAME>LD_SoC</SHORT-NAME>
              <LONG-NAME>
                <L-4 L="EN">E-04b comma device SoC</L-4>
              </LONG-NAME>
              <DESC>
                <L-2 L="EN">Qualcomm SoC running AGNOS Linux: the openpilot processes (E-01, E-02). Not an AUTOSAR ECU. Its link to the safety MCU is SPI (HSI-01), which AUTOSAR's system template has no bus type for; the link is described by the client-server and sender-receiver interfaces between the two compositions.</L-2>
              </DESC>
            </ECU-INSTANCE>
